сучасного міського пляжу нового формату, де поєднуються комфорт, безпека та інклюзивність. У літній сезон (травень–вересень) він стає важливою рекреаційною точкою Одеси, однак відвідувачам варто враховувати чинні правила безпеки та обмеження воєнного стану на узбережжі.</p>", "tourism_types": ["Морський туризм", "Розважальний туризм"], "description_en": "<p>A modern urban equipped beach that combines a comfortable vacation near the Black Sea with a high level of service and inclusive infrastructure. Located in the area of ​​Champagne Lane and Dolphin Beach, it is one of the most convenient and popular locations for recreation within the city.</p>", "hero_font_size": null, "reel_image_url": null, "detailed_info_en": "<p>A feature of \\"Caleton\\" is its accessibility for all categories of visitors, in particular for people with disabilities. There are ramps, special sunbeds and convenient access to the sea, which makes the beach one of the first inclusive beaches in Ukraine. The territory is compact, but functionally thought out, with clear zoning and comfortable living conditions. The infrastructure of the beach includes deck chairs, bungalows, shade canopies, showers, changing cabins, sanitary areas, rescue and medical posts, as well as cafes and lounge areas for relaxation. In the summer season, Wi-Fi is available, which enhances the convenience of the stay for guests. \\"Caleton\\" is an example of a modern city beach of a new format, where comfort, safety and inclusiveness are combined. In the summer season (May–September), it becomes an important recreational point of Odesa, but visitors should take into account the current safety regulations and martial law restrictions on the coast.</p>"}	{"id": "place-adar3k6j", "name": "Пляжний комплекс \\"Caleton\\"", "slug": "plyazhnyy-kompleks-caleton-0yil5h", "type": "attraction", "hours": "Пн-Нд: 08:00-20:00", "phone": "+38 097 789 02 02", "address": "м. Одеса, район Шампанського провулку, пляжу “Дельфін”, 4а", "city_i