льтурною спадщиною Одеси.</p><p>Пляж «Ланжерон» — це місце, де можна насолодитися морськими краєвидами, теплим сонцем і неповторною атмосферою чорноморського узбережжя. Це одна з тих локацій, яка найкраще передає курортний характер Одеси та дарує гостям яскраві враження у будь-яку пору літнього сезону.</p>", "tourism_types": ["Морський туризм", "Розважальний туризм"], "description_en": "<p>One of the most famous and favorite recreational locations of Odesa, where sea recreation is harmoniously combined with the atmosphere of the historic city. Located next to Shevchenko Park and just a few minutes from the center of Odesa, this beach has been a popular vacation spot for Odesa residents and guests of the city for many years.</p>", "hero_font_size": null, "reel_image_url": null, "detailed_info_en": "<p>A wide coastline, a comfortable sandy beach, a gentle entrance to the sea and modern infrastructure create excellent conditions for family vacations, walks and summer leisure. Comfortable beach areas with sunbeds and canopies, cafes and restaurants overlooking the sea, children's playgrounds, water activities and an equipped embankment for leisurely walks along the coast are available to guests. The proximity to iconic tourist sites of Odesa adds to the special attractiveness of Langeron. It is here that the famous Nemo Dolphinarium is located, the popular Health Route runs, and Shevchenko Park and the historic city center are very close by. Thanks to this, it is easy to combine a vacation on the beach with excursions, active leisure and familiarization with the cultural heritage of Odesa. Langeron Beach is a place where you can enjoy the sea views, the warm sun and the unique atmosphere of the Black Sea coast. This is one of those locations that best conveys the resort character of Odesa and gives guests bright impressions at any time of the summer season.</p>"}	{"id": "place-31xe0s64", "name": "Ланжерон", "slug": "lanzheron-llvw8j", "type": "attraction", "hours": null