ze": null, "reel_image_url": null, "detailed_info_en": "<p>Savranka has not only natural, but also historical value. Its name is associated with the ancient settlement of Savran, which is one of the oldest in the region. For centuries, the river served as an important source of water and resources for local communities, shaping life, traditions and economic activities around it. Today, Savranka is an attractive location for ecotourism and active recreation. Here you can enjoy peaceful walks along the water, fishing, photo tourism or just relaxing in nature. Picturesque views, silence and clean air make this area especially valuable for those looking for solitude and harmony with nature. The Savranka River is a place where the true natural Ukraine has been preserved. It gives an opportunity to regain strength, break away from the city rhythm and experience the beauty of living nature in its original form. This is a space that opens the Savran region as a region of peace, natural beauty and ecological tourism.</p>"}	\N	2026-06-09 11:40:49.042663+00
