on programs have been created, which make the stay in the water park even more interesting. A special feature of the complex is the developed infrastructure and a wide selection of additional services. On the territory there are restaurants with European, Odesa and Asian cuisine, a sushi bar, grill areas and food courts. For connoisseurs of increased comfort, a VIP area with a separate pool, jacuzzi bar, individual service, comfortable bungalows and its own restaurant is available. Thoughtful service allows you to combine active entertainment with a full-fledged rest in a resort atmosphere. Water park \\"Hawaii\\" is a place where everyone will find entertainment to their liking: from thrilling descents and water adventures to relaxing by the pool. The combination of modern attractions, high level of service and location in the center of Odesa resort life makes it one of the most attractive summer tourist locations of the city.</p>"}	\N	2026-06-09 13:23:17.416657+00
