ий простір, де поєднуються екологічний відпочинок, гастрономічні враження та оздоровчі практики. Локація дарує можливість сповільнити ритм життя, відчути силу природи та відкрити для себе новий формат відпочинку в самому серці Одещини.</p>", "tourism_types": ["Гастрономічний туризм", "Медико-оздоровчий туризм", "Розважальний туризм", "Сільський та зелений туризм"], "description_en": "<p>A unique space of ecotherapy and beekeeping in the north of Odesa, where nature, silence and traditions create ideal conditions for rest and recovery. Located in the picturesque Baltic region, this family project opens guests to the amazing world of bees and introduces the culture of Ukrainian beekeeping through the modern format of green tourism.</p>", "hero_font_size": null, "reel_image_url": null, "detailed_info_en": "<p>BeeVital's main feature is apitherapy houses, where you can feel the soothing effect of the natural buzzing of bees, enjoy the harmony of the environment and restore emotional balance. The atmosphere of peace, clean air and closeness to nature make this place a true center of mental reset. Visitors are offered tours of the apiary, tastings of natural honey and beekeeping products, workshops on making wax candles, thematic events and photo sessions among blooming honey plants. BeeVital brand creamed honey is especially popular, which has become a true gastronomic business card of the Baltic community. This is a modern tourist space that combines ecological recreation, gastronomic experiences and health practices. The location offers an opportunity to slow down the rhythm of life, feel the power of nature and discover a new format of recreation in the heart of Odesa.</p>"}	{"id": "place-rk1vakjn", "name": "Файний мед", "slug": "faynyy-med-w2wof7", "type": "attraction", "hours": "Відвідування виробництва за попереднім записом", "phone": "099 423 9689 Ткач Ольга Юріївна", "address": " м. Балта, вул. Лісна, Сімейний парк", "city_id": null, "map_url": null, "name_en": "