ву Одещину.</p><p>Савранський ліс — найбільший природний скарб степового півдня України та ідеальна локація для тих, хто шукає справжні враження серед дикої природи.</p>", "tourism_types": ["Медико-оздоровчий туризм", "Сільський та зелений туризм", "Спортивний туризм"], "description_en": "<p>Savran forest is a real natural wonder of Odesa, where a huge green oasis is spread among the endless steppes, filled with silence, fresh air and the unique beauty of wild nature.</p>", "hero_font_size": null, "reel_image_url": null, "detailed_info_en": "<p>This is the largest forest massif in the region with an area of ​​about 8,400 hectares, which impresses with its biodiversity and picturesque landscapes. The Savran forest is a unique place where steppe and forest ecosystems meet, creating a special natural world unlike any other corner of Southern Ukraine.</p><p>A walk through the Savran forest is an opportunity to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of real nature. Majestic oaks, lindens, ash trees and maples, some of which remember the events of two or three centuries ago, form dense green avenues and cozy forest glades. In the spring, the forest is covered with a carpet of primroses, in the summer it provides coolness even on the hottest days, and in the fall it turns into a bright palette of golden and crimson colors.</p><p>The Savran forest is home to hundreds of species of plants and animals. Here you can see roe deer, hares, foxes, hear the singing of nightingales and watch rare birds in their natural environment. For lovers of birdwatching and photo tourism, this is one of the most interesting natural locations in the region.</p><p>The Haydamatsky well is of particular historical value, a monument of the 18th century, associated with the events of the liberation struggle of the Ukrainian people. This location adds not only natural, but also historical content to the trip.</p><p>Savran forest offers excellent opportunities for eco-tourism, hiking, observing nature and relaxing from the urban rhythm of life. Marked tourist trails allow you to safely explore the natural wealth of the territory and discover new picturesque corners of the forest.</p><p>At any time of the year, the Savran forest impresses with its beauty and atmosphere. This is a place where you can feel the harmony with nature, regain your strength and see a completely different, green and forest Odesland.</p><p>Savran forest is the greatest natural treasure of the steppe south of Ukraine and an ideal location for those who are looking for real experiences in the wild nature.</p>"}	\N	2026-06-15 08:31:53.866119+00
