’язок із багатовіковими християнськими традиціями, відвідати богослужіння та познайомитися з релігійною спадщиною Подільська.</p>", "tourism_types": ["Релігійний туризм"], "description_en": "<p>The Church of the Assumption of the Blessed Virgin Mary in the city of Podilsk is a spiritual and cultural location that is an important part of the religious life of the community. The temple unites the faithful, preserves the traditions of Christian culture and creates a space for prayer, spiritual renewal and familiarization with the history of the city.</p>", "hero_font_size": null, "reel_image_url": null, "detailed_info_en": "<p>The church is the center of the Assumption of the Blessed Virgin Mary religious community in Podilsk and actively participates in the spiritual life of the city. Divine services, church events and community meetings are held here. The temple attracts visitors with its atmosphere of peace and spirituality. This is a place where you can feel the connection with centuries-old Christian traditions, attend a religious service and get acquainted with the religious heritage of Podilsk.</p>"}	{"id": "place-5o9iy9d4", "name": "Храм Успіння Пресвятої Богородиці", "slug": "khram-uspinnya-presvyatoyi-bohorodytsi-sq57mr", "type": "attraction", "hours": null, "phone": "+38 099 33 87134", "address": "м. Подільськ вулиця Успенська", "city_id": "city-2bmpg7kn", "map_url": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/g1xEJVY5Nv11xfrJ6", "name_en": "Church of the Assumption of the Holy Mother of God", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/792155726214991/", "hours_en": null, "reel_url": null, "subtitle": "Православний храм", "venue_id": null, "amenities": null, "image_url": "https://tourism.od.gov.ua/storage/v1/object/public/media/1782200238612-3kth9fbqa2j.jpg", "published": true, "video_url": null, "address_en": "Uspenska street, Podilsk", "repertoire": null, "description": "<p><strong>Храм Успіння Пресвятої Богородиці у місті Подільськ</strong> — це духовна та культурна локаці