ual life and remains a place of prayer, unity and preservation of Orthodox traditions. Special attention is drawn to the architecture of the temple, made in the traditions of Orthodox temple construction of the beginning of the 20th century. The majestic domes, the bell tower and the spacious interior create an atmosphere of solemnity and tranquility. Visitors can not only admire the beauty of the shrine, but also feel the special spiritual atmosphere of one of the most important religious centers of the region. The Dormition Cathedral of the Mother of God is a real business card of Balta and an important place of pilgrimage. The memory of Saint Theodosius Levytskyi is commemorated here, and the church itself has the status of a cathedral of the Baltic diocese. The combination of magnificent architecture, rich history and living spiritual tradition makes this shrine one of the most significant sacred objects of Odesa.</p>"}	\N	2026-06-24 07:52:16.756732+00
